                The ring of fractions of a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/strict+approximate+integral+domain"} strict approximate integral domain
                is a
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/local+ring"} local ring
            %li
              %p
                The ring of fractions of any
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/commutative+ring"} commutative ring
                is a
